"Protected values become placeholders like {PERSON_1}. Exact and compact, but an external AI sometimes rewrites the braces, and a rewritten placeholder cannot be restored." = "受保护的值会替换为 {PERSON_1} 这样的占位符。形式精确简洁，但外部 AI 有时会改写花括号，而改写后的占位符无法恢复。";
"Protected values become natural stand-in names like Company A or 甲公司. AI tools treat them as names and leave them alone, so documents come back restorable even after heavy editing." = "受保护的值会替换为 Company A 或甲公司这样的自然代称。AI 工具会将其视为名称而不作改动，因此即使经过大量编辑，文档仍可恢复。";
"Protected values are masked in place, like 张*明 or 138****5678, the form courts and regulators expect. Best for sending to a person; if two values share one mask, that mask is reported instead of guessed at restore." = "受保护的值会原位遮盖为张*明或 138****5678，这也是法院和监管机构惯用的格式。最适合发送给他人；若两个值产生相同的遮盖形式，恢复时会报告该形式，而不会作出猜测。";
"Bring documents in" = "导入文档";
"Drop Word, PDF, or text files (or a .zip). The app finds names, companies, dates, amounts, emails, phones, and IDs, and you review what it will protect." = "拖入 Word、PDF、文本文件或 .zip。App 会查找姓名、公司、日期、金额、电子邮件、电话号码和证件号码，您可审阅将要保护的内容。";
"Hand the safe copy to any AI" = "将安全副本交给任意 AI";
"Export for AI saves a redacted Markdown file. Upload it to ChatGPT, Claude, or any tool, with your instructions." = "“导出给 AI”会保存一个已隐去的 Markdown 文件。把它连同您的指令上传到 ChatGPT、Claude 或任何其他工具中。";
"Bring the answer back" = "取回回答";
