"LDA processes document contents and stores the encrypted mapping on this Mac. If you ask it to download a detection model, it connects to the model host. Copying or exporting a document lets you send it to a service you choose, so review that service's privacy settings first." = "LDA 会处理文档内容，并将加密映射存储在这台 Mac 上。如果您要求下载检测模型，它会连接到模型托管服务。复制或导出文档后，您可以将其发送至所选服务，因此请先查看该服务的隐私设置。";
"Anything you choose to keep visible stays visible in the exported document." = "您选择保持可见的任何内容都会在导出文档中保持可见。";
