"Enter an optional passphrase to encrypt the exported file. Leave it blank to protect it with the system Keychain." = "可选择输入密码短语以加密导出文件。留空则使用系统钥匙串保护该文件。";
"Enter an optional passphrase to encrypt the profile. Leave it blank to protect it with the system Keychain." = "可选择输入密码短语以加密资料集。留空则使用系统钥匙串保护该资料集。";
"If this profile was saved with a passphrase, enter it. Leave it blank if it uses the Keychain." = "如果此资料集是使用密码短语保存的，请输入该密码短语。如果它使用钥匙串，请留空。";
"Detection models process document text on this Mac. When you press Download, LDA connects to the configured model host to fetch the selected model file. Offline mode below tells LDA to refuse network requests, but it is an app setting rather than a firewall." = "检测模型在这台 Mac 上处理文档文本。点击下载时，LDA 会连接已配置的模型主机以获取所选模型文件。下方的离线模式会让 LDA 拒绝网络请求，但它是 App 内设置，不是防火墙。";
"Refuse all network requests, including model downloads. This is a setting inside LDA, not a firewall." = "拒绝所有网络请求，包括模型下载。这是 LDA 内部的设置，不是防火墙。";
"Quick is the smallest download and works on every Mac LDA supports. With 24 GB of memory or more, Balanced finds the same amount and leaves you far less to dismiss. Most thorough is the only one that missed nothing in our testing." = "快速是下载量最小的选项，并可在 LDA 支持的每台 Mac 上运行。如果内存为 24 GB 或以上，均衡能找到同样多的内容，同时需要排除的项目少得多。最彻底是我们的测试中唯一没有遗漏的设置。";
"A downloaded copy of %@ is also on this Mac. It is not needed because %@ is built into the app." = "这台 Mac 上也有一份已下载的 %@ 副本。%@ 已内置于 App，因此无需保留该副本。";
"%@ of %@" = "%@ / %@";
"Each round-trip records what was protected and what was restored. Records never contain the sensitive values themselves and stay encrypted on this Mac." = "每次往返都会记录哪些内容被保护和恢复。记录绝不包含敏感值本身，并且一直加密保存在这台 Mac 上。";
"Higher settings find more names, companies, and addresses, and take longer. Detection uses the selected model on this Mac." = "更高的设置能找到更多姓名、公司和地址，但所需时间也更长。检测使用这台 Mac 上选定的模型。";
"It reports a portion of the names and addresses it finds in a slightly different form from your document, so those are never redacted and never reach your review list. The Quick model does not have this problem and runs at the same speed." = "它会以与文档稍有不同的形式返回部分姓名和地址，因此这些内容不会被隐去，也不会进入审核列表。“快速”模型没有这个问题，而且运行速度相同。";
"LDA cannot estimate speed or memory for a model it does not know. It overrides the setting above." = "LDA 无法估计未知模型的速度或内存需求。它会覆盖上方设置。";
"The file holds this matter's documents, your review decisions, and the values needed to restore them. Choose a passphrase for it." = "该文件包含此事项的文档、您的审核决定以及恢复内容所需的值。请为其设置密码短语。";
