"The model for the detection level you chose is not installed, so this scan will not look for people's names or company names, and it matches an address only in the Chinese street form. It still finds emails, phones, dates, amounts, ID numbers, and case numbers. Add that model, or choose an installed level in Settings." = "你所选检测级别对应的模型尚未安装，因此本次扫描不会查找人名或公司名，地址也只有中文街道格式才能匹配到。它仍会找出电子邮件、电话、日期、金额、身份证号和案号。请添加该模型，或在“设置”中改选一个已安装的级别。";
"Patterns only is selected and no detection model is installed, so no scan on this Mac looks for people's names or company names. Those names stay in the document. Add a model, then choose a detection level in Settings." = "当前选择的是“仅使用规则”，且本机未安装检测模型，因此这台 Mac 上的任何扫描都不会查找人名或公司名。这些名称会留在文档里。请添加模型，然后在“设置”中选择检测级别。";
"This Mac does not have the memory to run a detection model, so scans here match patterns only. People's names and company names stay in the document." = "这台 Mac 的内存不足以运行检测模型，因此这里的扫描只能匹配规则。人名和公司名会留在文档里。";
"Document ready. Click Scan for PII to spot dates, amounts, emails, phones, and ID numbers. Names and company names need a detection model." = "文档已准备好。点击“扫描个人信息”以检测日期、金额、电子邮件、电话和身份证号。人名和公司名需要检测模型。";
"Spot PII in the open document: dates, amounts, emails, phones, ID numbers (Cmd+Shift+S). People's names and company names need a detection model." = "在打开的文档中查找个人信息：日期、金额、电子邮件、电话、身份证号（Cmd+Shift+S）。人名和公司名需要检测模型。";
"Drop Word, PDF, or text files (or a .zip). The app scans each one and you review what it will protect. Which kinds of value it can find depends on the detection model above." = "拖入 Word、PDF、文本文件或 .zip。App 会逐个扫描，你再审阅将要保护的内容。能找出哪些类型，取决于上方的检测模型。";
"Export a copy where the AI pass did not run?" = "要导出 AI 未运行过的副本吗？";
"The AI pass did not run on at least one of these documents, so people's names and company names were not looked for there and are still in the copy you are about to write. Read that copy before you hand it to an AI tool, or add a detection model and scan those documents again." = "这些文档中至少有一份没有运行 AI，因此其中的人名和公司名未被查找，仍然留在你即将写出的副本里。把副本交给 AI 工具之前请先通读，或者添加检测模型并重新扫描这些文档。";
"Export Anyway" = "仍然导出";
"No detection model is installed for the selected detection level, so people's names and company names were not looked for, and an address was matched only in the Chinese street form. Choose a different level in Settings, or add the model file." = "所选检测级别没有安装检测模型，因此没有查找人名和公司名，地址也只按中文街道格式匹配。请在“设置”中改选级别，或添加模型文件。";

/* Export gate: the partial-coverage body, kept apart from the one for a pass that never ran (2026-09-03). */
"Export a copy where the AI pass did not finish?" = "要导出 AI 未扫描完的副本吗？";
"The AI pass started on at least one of these documents and did not cover all of it, so some people's names and company names were found there and others were not. A review list can look complete and still be short of what the text holds. Read the copy you are about to write before you hand it to an AI tool, or scan those documents again." = "这些文档中至少有一份的 AI 扫描没有覆盖全文：其中一些人名和公司名被找了出来，另一些没有。待审阅清单看起来完整，仍可能少于文档中实际存在的内容。请在把即将写出的副本交给 AI 工具之前先通读它，或者重新扫描这些文档。";

// MARK: - Wizard language steps (2026-09-03)
"Step %lld of %lld" = "第 %lld 步，共 %lld 步";
"Choose a detection model" = "选择检测模型";
"Only a detection model finds the names of people and organisations. Without one, those names stay in the document, they are not in the review list, and the copy you hand to an AI tool still identifies your client." = "自然人姓名与单位名称须由检测模型识别；未安装模型的，该类信息留存于文档、不进入待审阅清单，交付 AI 工具的副本仍可识别委托人。";
"Recommended" = "推荐";
"Recommended: it fits this Mac with room to spare and leaves the least to dismiss." = "推荐：本机内存充裕，且须人工排除者最少。";
"Recommended because offline mode is on." = "离线模式已开启，推荐此项。";
"Runs on every Mac LDA supports. About one flag in five is one you will dismiss." = "LDA 支持的所有 Mac 均可运行；约每五处标记有一处须排除。";
"Misses as little as Quick, with a third as much to dismiss." = "漏检与“快速”相当，须排除者约为其三分之一。";
"Missed nothing in testing, including the Chinese bank branch name Balanced missed. About twice the wait of Balanced." = "测试中并无漏检，含“标准”漏检的中文银行分行名称；耗时约为“标准”两倍。";
"No model runs. The names of people and organisations are not detected." = "不运行模型；自然人姓名与单位名称不予检测。";
"This Mac has %lld GB of memory, so %@ cannot run here." = "本机内存 %lld GB，%@ 不可运行。";
"Download and Use" = "下载并启用";
"Downloading connects to %@. If that is unreachable, add a file you got on another Mac." = "下载将连接 %@；无法访问的，可导入在另一台 Mac 上取得的文件。";
"Offline mode is on, so downloads are off. You can still add a file you got on another Mac." = "离线模式已开启，不提供下载；可导入在另一台 Mac 上取得的文件。";
"No model runs. In our own test on two agreements, a scan with no model missed 32 of the 36 names, organisations, and addresses. Fixed formats are still found, and LDA asks again before the first scan of each document." = "不运行模型。经我方测试，未装模型的扫描在 36 项姓名、名称与地址中漏检 32 项；固定格式信息仍予检出，首次扫描前会再次提示。";
"Downloading the detection model." = "正在下载检测模型。";
"Installed and in use. Scans will now find the names of people and organisations." = "已安装并启用；此后扫描将检测自然人姓名与单位名称。";
"LDA protects client information before it reaches an AI tool, and puts it back afterwards." = "LDA 在文档交付 AI 工具之前对委托人信息脱敏，事后再行还原。";
"Re-scan" = "重新扫描";
"matter" = "该事项";
"Save Redacted and Save Workspace need a document. Click Open to add one." = "“存储已隐去文档”和“存储工作区”都需要一份文档。点击“打开”以添加。";
"Save Redacted waits for this document to finish opening." = "“存储已隐去文档”需等待此文档打开完成。";
"Save Redacted waits for this scan to finish." = "“存储已隐去文档”需等待本次扫描完成。";
"Save Redacted needs a finished scan. Click Scan for PII first." = "“存储已隐去文档”需要一次已完成的扫描。请先点击“扫描个人信息”。";
"This document did not open, so there is nothing to save. Open the file again." = "此文档未能打开，因此没有内容可存储。请重新打开该文件。";
"Export Report covers an Export for AI handoff. Run one first." = "“导出报告”记录的是一次“导出给 AI”交付。请先执行一次。";
"Review the restored document" = "检查恢复后的文档";
"Nothing has been written yet. Read the restored text, correct any value that is wrong, then choose where the document goes." = "目前尚未写入任何文件。请阅读恢复后的文本，更正有误的值，然后选择文档的存储位置。";
"%lld value will be restored." = "将恢复 %lld 个值。";
"%lld values will be restored." = "将恢复 %lld 个值。";
"Restored document" = "恢复后的文档";
"Values this restore will write" = "本次恢复将写入的值";
"Correcting a value here changes the mapping, not the text of the document. The restore writes your correction at every site that placeholder appears." = "在此更正某个值只会修改映射，不会修改文档正文。恢复时，您的更正会写入该占位符出现的每一处位置。";
"These cannot be corrected here. A placeholder that is missing from the mapping or damaged by editing is not a recorded value, and a masked form several entities share has no single owner. Settle those by hand in the saved document." = "这些内容无法在此更正。映射中缺失或在编辑时受损的占位符并不是已记录的值；由多个实体共用的遮盖形式也没有唯一归属。请在存储后的文档中手动处理这些位置。";
"Output format" = "输出格式";
"Markdown" = "Markdown";
"Plain text" = "纯文本";
"Word document" = "Word 文档";
"Choose Where to Save…" = "选择存储位置…";
"Where the mapping is kept" = "映射保存在哪里";
"LDA keeps this document's mapping in a workspace on this Mac, named after the document. Restore finds it there, so the redacted document you send carries no key beside it." = "LDA 会把本文档的映射保存在这台 Mac 上的一个工作区中，并以该文档命名。恢复会在那里找到它，因此您发出的已隐去文档旁边不带任何密钥。";
"Also save a mapping file next to the redacted document" = "同时在已隐去文档旁保存一个映射文件";
"Only this file can restore the document on another Mac. Send it to someone who should be able to, and give them the passphrase separately." = "只有该文件才能在另一台 Mac 上恢复本文档。请只发给应当能够恢复它的人，并另行告知密码短语。";
"Enter a passphrase for this mapping file." = "请为该映射文件输入密码短语。";
"Choose a folder for the redacted document." = "为已隐去文档选择一个文件夹。";
"An export finished after you switched matters. Its mapping was kept in \"%@\" for the matter it was started in, and was not loaded into this session. Open that workspace to restore that document." = "导出在你切换案件之后才完成。它的映射已保存在 \"%@\" 中，归属于开始导出时的案件，未载入当前会话。请打开那个工作区以复原该文档。";
"This file changed after the preview was computed, so the document that would be written is not the one you approved. Nothing was written. Open the file again to preview it as it is now." = "此文件在生成预览之后发生了改动，将要写出的文档并不是你批准的那一份。没有写出任何内容。请重新打开该文件，按它当前的内容重新预览。";
"Mapping kept in: %@  ·  %@" = "映射保存于：%@  ·  %@";
"Restored with the workspace LDA keeps for this document." = "已使用 LDA 为本文档保存的工作区恢复。";
"Choose or drop the file that came back: the Markdown you exported for the AI, or a redacted Word document you saved. The mapping is found automatically from this session, from the workspace LDA keeps for the document, or from a .ldamap saved next to the file. Formatting is kept when the file is a Word document." = "选择或拖入返回的文件：您导出给 AI 的 Markdown，或您保存的已隐去 Word 文档。映射会自动从本次会话、LDA 为该文档保存的工作区，或文件旁的 .ldamap 中找到。若文件是 Word 文档，格式将得到保留。";
"No single mapping was found for this file." = "未能为该文件找到唯一的映射。";
"Choose the .ldamap saved with it, or the workspace for the document it came from." = "请选择与它一起保存的 .ldamap，或该文件所属文档的工作区。";
"Choose the .ldamap or workspace file that goes with this document." = "请选择与本文档配套的 .ldamap 或工作区文件。";
"Workspace passphrase" = "工作区密码短语";
"That workspace file holds no mapping yet." = "该工作区文件中还没有映射。";
"Save this document redacted in its original format. The mapping is kept in a workspace on this Mac, and Restore brings the document back with formatting preserved." = "以原始格式保存本文档的已隐去版本。映射保存在这台 Mac 上的一个工作区中，恢复会连同格式一起把文档带回。";
"The redacted document was not saved because its mapping had nowhere to go. Nothing can restore a document without its mapping, so the file was removed rather than left in place looking finished. Add a passphrase to save a mapping beside the document, or check that this Mac allows LDA to store keys." = "脱敏文档未保存，因为其映射无处存放。没有映射便无法还原文档，因此该文件已被删除，而不是留在原处、看起来像是已完成的成果。请设置口令以在文档旁保存映射，或检查本机是否允许 LDA 存储密钥。";
"When this workspace was saved, the AI pass had not run on this document, so people's names and company names were not looked for. Scan it again with a detection model, or read the copy before you hand it to an AI tool." = "存储此工作区时，AI 尚未在这份文档上运行，因此其中的人名和公司名未被查找。请使用检测模型重新扫描，或者在把副本交给 AI 工具之前先通读它。";
"When this workspace was saved, the AI pass had not covered all of this document, so some people's names and company names were found and others were not. Scan it again, or read the copy before you hand it to an AI tool." = "存储此工作区时，AI 扫描尚未覆盖这份文档的全文：其中一些人名和公司名被找了出来，另一些没有。请重新扫描，或者在把副本交给 AI 工具之前先通读它。";
"This workspace was saved before LDA recorded whether the AI pass ran, so this document is treated as if it did not. Scan it again, or read the copy before you hand it to an AI tool." = "此工作区存储于 LDA 开始记录 AI 是否运行之前，因此这份文档按 AI 未运行处理。请重新扫描，或者在把副本交给 AI 工具之前先通读它。";
"Save Redacted found this file changed after it was scanned, so the scan no longer describes it. Open the file again and scan it before saving." = "“存储已隐去文档”发现此文件在扫描之后已被更改，扫描结果不再与之对应。请重新打开该文件并再次扫描，然后再存储。";
"This document no longer reads as it did when this workspace was saved, so the scan it recorded does not describe the text that is open. Scan it again, or read the copy before you hand it to an AI tool." = "这份文档的文本与存储此工作区时已不相同，因此所记录的扫描结果并不描述当前打开的文本。请重新扫描，或者在把副本交给 AI 工具之前先通读它。";
"Save Workspace found \"%@\" changed after it was scanned, so its review no longer describes it. Open the file again and scan it before saving the workspace." = "“存储工作区”发现“%@”在扫描之后已被更改，其审阅结果不再与之对应。请重新打开该文件并再次扫描，然后再存储工作区。";
